---
import Base from "@layouts/Base.astro";
import { brand } from "../brand/config";
---

<Base
  title="How it works"
  description={`A clear look at the plans, cancellations, correspondence and optional care at ${brand.name}.`}
  canonicalPath="/how-it-works/"
>
  <section class="pwy-page pwy-how" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <div class="pwy-shell">
      <header class="pwy-hero">
        <p class="pwy-kicker">The arrangement / 01</p>
        <div class="pwy-hero__grid">
          <h1 id="how-heading">How it works</h1>
          <p class="pwy-hero__lede">{brand.copy.howItWorks.lede}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pwy-hero__meta" aria-label="Current membership status">
          <span class="pwy-stamp">On schedule</span>
          <span>Waitlist open</span>
          <span>Paid membership closed</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="pwy-lifecycle" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-heading">
        <div class="pwy-section-heading">
          <p class="pwy-kicker">A plan, completed</p>
          <h2 id="lifecycle-heading">The cancellation is the point.</h2>
          <p>
            Every ordinary plan is made on purpose, allowed to gather a little anticipation, then
            cancelled on purpose. You are not expected to attend. Nothing has gone wrong.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ol class="pwy-lifecycle__rail">
          {
            brand.copy.emotionalArc.map((_step, index) => (
              <li class={`pwy-lifecycle__step${index === 4 ? " pwy-lifecycle__step--signal" : ""}`}>
                <span class="pwy-step-number">0{index + 1}</span>
                <span>
                  {index === 0
                    ? "Listed"
                    : index === 1
                      ? "Made"
                      : index === 2
                        ? "Plausible"
                        : index === 3
                          ? "Approaching"
                          : index === 4
                            ? "Unmade"
                            : "Still listed"}
                </span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ol>
        <p class="pwy-arc-summary">{brand.copy.emotionalArc.join(" → ")}</p>
        <p class="pwy-caption">
          The invitation and cancellation stay together, so you can always tell what changed. The
          relationship carries on after the plan is unmade.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pwy-schedule" aria-labelledby="schedule-heading">
        <div class="pwy-section-heading">
          <p class="pwy-kicker">The rhythm</p>
          <h2 id="schedule-heading">Made with a date. Finished with care.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="pwy-schedule__grid">
          <article class="pwy-schedule__card">
            <p class="pwy-card-code">01 / your pace</p>
            <h3>You choose the tempo.</h3>
            <p>
              Choose occasional, about monthly, a couple per month, or let us use our discretion.
              The cadence is approximate and can be changed at any time.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="pwy-schedule__card pwy-schedule__card--signal">
            <p class="pwy-card-code">02 / status</p>
            <h3>We send the cancellation.</h3>
            <p>
              Invitations generally arrive 7–21 days before the date on them. Cancellations
              generally arrive 12–36 hours before it. The windows vary naturally; the outcome does
              not.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="pwy-schedule__card">
            <p class="pwy-card-code">03 / continuity</p>
            <h3>You remain on the list.</h3>
            <p>
              A silent member is a successful member. You do not need to reply, attend, network,
              post, log in frequently, or perform a version of sociability for us.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="pwy-two-column" aria-labelledby="memory-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="pwy-kicker">What we remember / 02</p>
          <h2 id="memory-heading">Remembered, with permission.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="pwy-prose">
          <p>
            We remember what you choose to share: a preferred name, a birthday, an address when you
            opt into physical mail, interests, pets, inside jokes and a do-not-mention list. You can
            see, edit and remove what we hold. We keep track of where a detail came from, and we do
            not use a suggestion unless you confirm it.
          </p>
          <p>
            Physical mail, gifts, calls and help with a commitment are separate and optional. They
            happen only when your membership includes them, you have opted in, and we have what we
            need to do them properly. Change your mind and future work stops.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="pwy-operator" aria-labelledby="operator-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="pwy-kicker">The human hand / 03</p>
          <h2 id="operator-heading">The details stay clear. People keep the promise.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Real operators review selected correspondence, print and post letters, choose gifts within
          a budget, make opted-in calls and handle the rare cancellation that needs human attention.
          If something cannot be completed safely or on time, it is handed to a person. Nothing is
          left hanging without an answer.
        </p>
      </section>

      <footer class="pwy-page-footer">
        <p>Want the next notice when membership opens?</p>
        <a class="pwy-button" href="/waiting-list/"
          >Join the waitlist <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </footer>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .pwy-page {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .pwy-shell {
    max-width: 78rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .pwy-hero {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pwy-kicker,
  .pwy-card-code {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font: 600 0.72rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pwy-hero__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(16rem, 0.9fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 9rem);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .pwy-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 clamp(3.2rem, 9vw, 8rem)/0.86 var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }
  .pwy-hero__lede {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .pwy-hero__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font: 0.72rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pwy-stamp {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .pwy-section-heading {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .pwy-section-heading h2,
  .pwy-two-column h2,
  .pwy-operator h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font: 400 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem)/0.98 var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .pwy-section-heading > p:last-child,
  .pwy-prose p,
  .pwy-operator > p {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle,
  .pwy-schedule,
  .pwy-two-column,
  .pwy-operator {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle__rail {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(8rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--fg);
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle__step {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    min-height: 7rem;
    padding: 1rem 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font: 0.9rem/1.3 var(--font-serif);
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle__step::before {
    content: "";
    width: 0.65rem;
    height: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: -0.32rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--fg);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle__step--signal {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .pwy-lifecycle__step--signal::before {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .pwy-step-number {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font: 0.68rem/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .pwy-arc-summary {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font: italic 1rem/1.45 var(--font-serif);
  }
  .pwy-caption {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .pwy-schedule__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pwy-schedule__card {
    min-height: 16rem;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .pwy-schedule__card--signal .pwy-card-code {
    color: var(--accent-secondary);
  }
  .pwy-schedule__card--signal {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }
  .pwy-schedule__card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font: 400 clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2rem)/1 var(--font-serif);
  }
  .pwy-schedule__card p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .pwy-two-column,
  .pwy-operator {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(14rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 10rem);
  }
  .pwy-prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .pwy-prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .pwy-operator {
    align-items: start;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--bg-elev));
  }
  .pwy-operator > p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .pwy-page-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }
  .pwy-page-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .pwy-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .pwy-button:hover,
  .pwy-button:focus-visible {
    background: var(--accent-secondary);
    color: #fff;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .pwy-hero__grid,
    .pwy-two-column,
    .pwy-operator {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .pwy-lifecycle__rail {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      border-top: 0;
    }
    .pwy-lifecycle__step {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .pwy-schedule__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
